      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIZZIES SON (3) settled close to the pace then took control of the race and scored in a 2200m race at Marburg last start, arriving 11 metres ahead of his rivals. Won't find this any harder and he can salute once again. BLACK VIPER (8) was unplaced two starts ago then things went amiss last start when he broke and finished 3 metres away in fourth over 2138m at this track. Only needs to get things right to be in contention. LOCHINVAR SON (2) has to come into calculations on the back of some strong recent form, most recently when second at this track over 2138m. Must be included. VICTREE VIC (1) broke last start and finished a distant ninth over 2138m at this track. That came after a eighth to launch this campaign on October 2. With better racing manners is a live chance in a similar assignment.",
